  "description": "FsDiff is an automatic differentiation (AD) library.AD allows exact and efficient calculation of derivatives, by systematically invoking the chain rule of calculus at the elementary operator level during program execution.FsDiff supports nested forward and reverse AD up to any level. Derivative calculations (gradients, Hessians, Jacobians, directional derivatives, and matrix-free Hessian- and Jacobian-vector products) can be incorporated with minimal change into existing algorithms.",
